Change:
  SharedRocksDbResources.requireWorkerActivationReady now rejects missing
  runtime observations and non-ACTIVE shared resource gates. Both Lane and
  Target Worker shard compositions call it before binding/creating their source
  loops, so the legacy unprobed resource constructor cannot silently disable
  production Worker safety fencing. Embedded callers may still use that
  constructor without composing a production Worker.

